# Canopy Stair (CIPlay canopy_stair): the shelf round 0 4 at 10 m, the two tents, the anchor box 2 18.
island Canopy Stair
# RESIZE 10-24: the recipe moved this island's old content by 0 -20.9; the points below are in the old frame
offset 0 20.9
expect step 0
expect title The Climb
zone shelf
expect step 1
read Seedkeepers' roll call
expect step 2
open Tent chest
wait 3
expect step 3
open Jonas' tent chest
wait 3
expect step 4
use stairvines
expect shown coil1
open Stair ledge
wait 3
expect story ropecoil 1
open West ledge
wait 3
open East root
wait 3
expect story ropecoil 3
expect step 5
expect hidden anchorbox
use anchorwinch
expect story ropecoil 0
expect shown anchorbox
expect step 6
open Anchor box
wait 3
expect step 7
zone cs_top
expect step 8
open Plane's cockpit locker
wait 3
expect story pilotkey 1
expect step 9
use pilotlock
expect shown pilotchest
read Pilot's flight log
expect step 10
read Oda's letter
expect step 11
# U22 jump course (10-24): teleport onto its top A slab instead of jumping the hops
at -72.38 -4.56 h=10.65
zone jump_cs_top
wait 2
expect done
